        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XaA4d349woAQ0Dx28kTlHfIWg4g\"><em><strong>The maps below show the changes in a town after the construction of a hydroelectric power dam. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Town Changes After Hydroelectric Dam Construction</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/tuukeZJFbhg?si=BwxxyLmDNhn9fTz6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HiLFd1qKVoUCcGxdTIwlkPs2gbe\">Đề b&agrave;i Town Changes After Hydroelectric Dam Construction y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của<strong> </strong>một thị trước trước v&agrave; sau khi x&acirc;y thủy điện&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VhmXdzsXsoYF0Bxh2dylIJpmgye\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Town Changes After Hydroelectric Dam Construction với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: thay đổi của thị trấn - 1990 v&agrave; 2010 - x&acirc;y thủy điện</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(79, 84, 100);\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KMHJdx8isoyY3WxEOkBlnEGwgPe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjGed7H6foEGRVxL21slm8IZgjg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Cảnh quan thi&ecirc;n nhi&ecirc;n biến mất để x&acirc;y cơ sở hạ tầng cho thủy điện</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FdmZdKGh8oEt9KxEIGQlT3wFgrg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXcjdp5FRoz2HextIA1liUhXgFG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXcjdp5FRoz2HextIA1liUhXgFG\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a T&acirc;y</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P9Ehdsk36o5f9sx9x35ldHNBg4f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PFHcdEP8roeC6wxzmJCl1KP7gbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thị trấn v&agrave;o năm 1990:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Al0SdRyV9ov7sQxWwyDlo1PQgtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; <strong>forest</strong>, c&oacute; <strong>ancient structure</strong> v&agrave; nơi sinh sống của <strong>rare plants</strong> v&agrave; <strong>animals</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzWHdCLfxo06v2x5CUPlmvA7glf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay đổi </strong><strong>t&iacute;nh đến năm 2010:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQKdhlGDon96Vxv5yflwdblgFe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Forest, </strong><strong>ancient structure </strong>and<strong> </strong>nơi sinh sống của<strong> </strong><strong>rare plants</strong> v&agrave; <strong>animals</strong> biến mất để x&acirc;y <strong>transmission towers</strong>, thế nhưng <strong>mountain range</strong><strong>s</strong> th&igrave; lại kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjJidtvHzoVw26xgHLelWsLcg1b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VC1Hdop0Fo42olxIok2lHlrrgZf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VC1Hdop0Fo42olxIok2lHlrrgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c thay đổi ở ph&iacute;a Đ&ocirc;ng</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VabgdPG43ocCR1xs5u3l0hYegbf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S50ad9RRtoDL2vxgCk6l1gcxgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thị trấn v&agrave;o năm 1990:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BiAOde5EnoQLIHxVv3clt1qogYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&oacute; <strong>mountains</strong> v&agrave; <strong>irrigated farmlands</strong> v&agrave; <strong>villages</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZApHdciMeoySctxLb5BloqT5gCb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay </strong><strong>đổi t&iacute;nh đến năm 2010:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoRMdyVRloEbXkxKXMClHTbtgbc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X&acirc;y th&ecirc;m <strong>hydroelectric dam</strong> v&agrave; <strong>transmission towers</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P54kdXqqwoBHCYxjNc6lB7UXgnc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Xuất hiện <strong>lake</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IldPdVlLTo6AEMxOW4plNCXQg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Irrigated farmlands</strong> biến mất để x&acirc;y <strong>hotel</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V999dZSGLo5odzx1n9NlU7sOgzh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Villages </strong>kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
