            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 583,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NDDWd6tfHoO2KhxmNuzlw74NgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NDDWd6tfHoO2KhxmNuzlw74NgOc\">To the east of the river, the landscape in 1990 was relatively undeveloped, featuring mountains and irrigated farmlands, along with villages. However, by 2010, this area had been dramatically transformed with the construction of a hydroelectric dam and the creation of a large lake. Multiple electricity transmission towers were installed across the region, and the irrigated farmland gave way to a new hotel. Despite these significant changes, the existing villages on this side of the river were also maintained.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
